<view class="page">
  <!-- 顶部品牌横幅：日期 + 问候 + 家庭徽章 -->
  <view class="hero-band">
    <view class="band-date">{{dateLabel}}</view>
    <view class="band-sub" wx:if="{{!noMembers}}">今天的营养搭配已经备好 ✨</view>
    <view class="band-chip" wx:if="{{!noMembers}}" bindtap="onGoFamily">
      👨‍👩‍👧 {{summary.count}} 口人 · 每日约 {{summary.kcal}} kcal ›
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="overlap">

  <!-- 没有家庭成员时的引导 -->
  <view class="card empty-family" wx:if="{{noMembers}}">
    <view class="ef-icon">👨‍👩‍👧</view>
    <view>还没有家庭成员，无法生成菜单</view>
    <view class="muted ef-note">按你家实际情况添加成员（一位老人、两位老人、有孩子……都可以），菜单份量和营养目标会完全按真实成员计算。</view>
    <button class="btn-primary ef-btn" bindtap="onGoFamily">去设置家庭成员</button>
  </view>

  <block wx:if="{{!noMembers}}">

  <view class="card notice" wx:if="{{isDefaultFamily}}" bindtap="onGoFamily">
    ✍️ 当前按"2 位成人"的默认家庭生成菜单，点这里设置真实的家庭成员（老人、孩子都可自由组合），份量和营养会自动调整。
  </view>

  <view class="card notice" wx:if="{{noSpicyAll}}">
    🌶️🚫 已开启全家免辣：今天的菜单不含任何辣菜（可在"我的家庭"关闭）。
  </view>

  <view class="card notice" wx:if="{{noPorkAll}}">
    🐷🚫 已开启不吃猪肉：今天的菜单不含任何猪肉及含酒精食材的菜（可在"我的家庭"关闭）。
  </view>

  <view class="card notice" wx:if="{{toddlerTip}}">
    👶 家有 3 岁以下幼儿：给宝宝的部分请单独少盐、食材切小块，整虾整颗坚果等谨防呛噎。
  </view>

  <!-- 三餐卡片 -->
  <view class="card" wx:for="{{mealList}}" wx:key="key" wx:for-item="meal">
    <view class="card-title">
      <text>{{meal.emoji}} {{meal.label}} <text class="meal-cost">{{meal.costText}}</text></text>
      <view class="shuffle" data-meal="{{meal.key}}" catchtap="onShuffleMeal">🔄 换一换</view>
    </view>
    <view class="divider"></view>
    <view
      class="dish"
      wx:for="{{meal.dishes}}"
      wx:key="id"
      wx:for-item="dish"
      data-id="{{dish.id}}"
      bindtap="onOpenRecipe"
    >
      <image
        wx:if="{{dish.image}}"
        class="dish-photo"
        src="{{dish.image}}"
        mode="aspectFill"
        lazy-load="{{true}}"
      ></image>
      <view wx:else class="dish-avatar cover-{{dish.type}}">{{dish.emoji}}</view>
      <view class="dish-main">
        <view class="dish-name">{{dish.name}}</view>
        <view class="dish-meta">
          <text class="tag" wx:for="{{dish.tags}}" wx:key="*this" wx:for-item="t">{{t}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="dish-right">
        <view class="dish-kcal">人均 {{dish.nutrition.kcal}} kcal<text wx:if="{{dish.costText}}"> · 全家{{dish.costText}}</text></view>
        <view class="muted">⏱ {{dish.time}} 分钟 ›</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 营养分析 -->
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{totals}}">
    <view class="card-title">今日全家营养分析</view>
    <view class="divider"></view>
    <view class="nutrient">
      <view class="n-label">能量</view>
      <view class="bar"><view class="bar-fill" style="width: {{percents.kcal}}%"></view></view>
      <view class="n-val">{{totals.kcal}}/{{summary.kcal}} kcal</view>
    </view>
    <view class="nutrient">
      <view class="n-label">蛋白质</view>
      <view class="bar"><view class="bar-fill" style="width: {{percents.protein}}%"></view></view>
      <view class="n-val">{{totals.protein}}/{{summary.protein}} g</view>
    </view>
    <view class="nutrient">
      <view class="n-label">钙</view>
      <view class="bar"><view class="bar-fill" style="width: {{percents.calcium}}%"></view></view>
      <view class="n-val">{{totals.calcium}}/{{summary.calcium}} mg</view>
    </view>
    <view class="nutrient">
      <view class="n-label">铁</view>
      <view class="bar"><view class="bar-fill" style="width: {{percents.iron}}%"></view></view>
      <view class="n-val">{{totals.iron}}/{{summary.iron}} mg</view>
    </view>
    <view class="divider"></view>
    <view class="cost-line">
      <text>💰 今日预估买菜花费</text>
      <text class="cost-num">约 ¥{{dayCost}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="muted nut-note">
      * 营养按《中国居民膳食营养素参考摄入量》估算，加餐的水果、奶类不在此列，缺口可用它们补足。价格为盒马/奥乐齐参考价，以门店为准。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="bottom-space"></view>
  <view class="bottom-bar">
    <button class="btn-primary buy-btn" bindtap="onGoShopping">🛒 生成今日购物清单</button>
    <button class="btn-ghost share-btn" open-type="share">↗️ 分享</button>
  </view>

  </block>

  </view>
</view>
